## Cursor planner routing (explicit invocation only)

This managed rule is generated from `packages/planner/configs/command-routing.json`.
Apply only when the owner explicitly invokes planner or attaches this manual rule.
Ordinary requests and existing plan files do not activate planner.

- Fixed economy commands: none.
- Fixed implementation commands: `planner:dev`, `planner:fix`, `planner:make-workflow`, `planner:plan-close`, `planner:review`.
- Fixed frontier commands: `planner:design`, `planner:plan-audit`, `planner:plan-design`, `planner:research`.
- Model selectors: economy=composer-2.5-fast, implementation=composer-2.5, frontier=claude-opus-5-thinking-high.
- Never replace fixed frontier or fixed implementation routes with `auto`.
